OL,3,AFarmer who says 999 call foiled RAF
OL,4,AFairford plot only has 'partial
OL,5,Apicture', defence secretary tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FGloucestershire Police say they were
OL,8,Falerted at about 00:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,9,FFive men remain in custody - they were
OL,10,Farrested under the Explosives Act and
OL,11,Fon suspicion of preparing a terrorist
OL,12,Fact
OL,14,FThe RAF base is used by the US
OL,15,Fmilitary. President Trump says the US
OL,16,Fhad the five men "under view for a long
OL,17,Ftime, and we got them"
OL,19,FOne person who lives near the base
OL,20,Ftells us that local people were sent
OL,21,Fhome by armed police just hours before
OL,22,Fthe suspects were arrested
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
